# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# QUOTES - AUTHZ (ALL 11 ROUTES, MechanicOnly POLICY)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@SomeVehicleId = 1
@SomeQuoteId = 1
@SomeQuoteLineId = 1
@SomeVersion = 1

# COVERAGE GAP (do not fill with a fabricated token):
# The F3 brief asks every route below to also prove that a request carrying a
# valid CUSTOMER token gets 403 (authenticated but not authorized), not 401.
# That case cannot be produced against the live API today, for exactly the
# reason already recorded in catalog-authz.http: Customer person records never
# receive an IdentityUserId (DemoDataInitializer.cs: "Customers are passive
# data records - no login account, no IdentityUserId") and
# POST /api/auth/register only accepts personType "Mechanic"
# (AuthEndpoints.Register.cs: "Registration is only available for
# mechanics."). No endpoint issues a session for a person whose person_type
# claim resolves to "customer", so MechanicOnly (Program.cs:
# RequireClaim("person_type","mechanic")) can only currently be observed
# distinguishing "authenticated" from "unauthenticated" below, never
# "authenticated non-mechanic" from "authenticated mechanic".
#
# The path ids below are literals on purpose: an unauthenticated request is
# rejected by the policy before any handler resolves them, so whether the row
# exists is irrelevant here. Every other file in this folder resolves its
# fixtures from the seeded quotes instead.


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [Setup][QuotesAuthz] Logout before unauthenticated checks
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated list quotes (401 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated get quote by id (401 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated update quote (401 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthenticated",
  "notes": null,
  "version": {{SomeVersion}}
}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated delete quote (401 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}?version={{SomeVersion}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated add quote line (401 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}/lines
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lineKind": "Part",
  "quantity": 1,
  "description": "Unauthenticated",
  "netUnitPrice": 100,
  "vatRatePercent": 27,
  "version": {{SomeVersion}}
}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated update quote line (401 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}/lines/{{SomeQuoteLineId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lineKind": "Part",
  "quantity": 1,
  "description": "Unauthenticated",
  "netUnitPrice": 100,
  "vatRatePercent": 27,
  "version": {{SomeVersion}}
}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated delete quote line (401 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}/lines/{{SomeQuoteLineId}}?version={{SomeVersion}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated change quote status (401 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}/status
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Sent",
  "version": {{SomeVersion}}
}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated extend quote validity (401 expected)
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/quotes/{{SomeQuoteId}}/valid-until
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "validUntil": "2030-01-01T00:00:00",
  "version": {{SomeVersion}}
}

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated list a vehicle's quotes (401 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/{{SomeVehicleId}}/quotes

###

### [Negative][QuotesAuthz] Unauthenticated create a quote for a vehicle (401 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/{{SomeVehicleId}}/quotes
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthenticated",
  "notes": null,
  "validUntil": null,
  "appointmentId": null
}
